OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian excited for station's
OL,4,Arecord attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FA former Team GB Olympian says he is
OL,7,F"excited" ahead of BBC Hereford &
OL,8,FWorcester's attempt to set a new
OL,9,FGuinness World Record.
OL,11,FSteve Cram, a silver medallist in the
OL,12,F1,500m at the 1984 games, set the
OL,13,Fstation the challenge of running the
OL,14,Ffastest half marathon while presenting
OL,15,Fa live radio show.
OL,17,FThat challenge has fallen to executive
OL,18,Fproducer Tim Boswell who must complete
OL,19,Fthe Worcester City Half Marathon in
OL,20,Funder two hours and 30 minutes on
OL,21,FSunday.
OL,23,APub: 11-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,357,350,200,160,0,100
