OL,3,GNEWSAOlympian excited for station's
OL,4,Arecord attempt
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe runner turned athletics commentator
OL,7,Fsaid: "He's going to have so much to
OL,8,Ftalk about. We're so looking forward to
OL,9,Fit and it's our biggest ever Worcester
OL,10,FCity Run - it gets bigger every year."
